

   The cure to some simple problems:
   ======================================



 - User can't Upload a file:
   You probably have no directory called 'trion:upload/'

 - You have changed a BBSText config file but nothing changed.
   Try to run the BBStext programm and login again.

 - You have changed a menu but nothing is changed.
   Try to compile the menus with 'menu #?'.
   An other problem can be that the menu was in use while it
   was compiled, if that menu is not at the menu prompt it can't
   be compiled.

 - You wan't to make a mailer call, but nothing happens.
   You need a nodelist with the number of the node in it, the name
   of the nodelist has to be in the trion:cfg/nodelist.cfg.
   There is no mail for the node, try to make some with the 'poll' util.

 - Xprzmodem and Xprzedzap libraries don't work.

   Note that the Xprzmodem.library V3.50 and Xprzedzap.library V3.50
   don't work on a machine with a 68000 for some reason.
   Older Xprzmodem.library's do work , but there is no old
   Xprzedzap.library that works 100% , so if you want to use the
   mailer you have to disable ZEDZAP in the trion:cfg/trion-X.cfg

 - File transfers under Hydra of bigger files are very slow
   when polling for mail.

   This is a problem with HydraCom V1.0
   Use the Mui_HydraCom V1.11 or better .. it has no such problems.

